{"id":"00128","root":"uni00128_1","name":{"ja":"トロール","en":"Troll"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"トロール","en":"Troll"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":null,"limited":false,"characterId":111,"profile":{"ja":"魔界に生息する亜人種。3メートルはある巨体の怪物。人間界において闇の勢力がオークやオーガと並びよく使役している。知能は低いが凶暴で怪力、何よりもタフで浅い傷ならすぐに再生してしまう。女であれば如何なる種族の女であれ犯し、生きたまま食らってしまう。紫外線に弱く、皮膚が固まってしまうため動きが極端に鈍くなるが、伝説であるように石になってしまうわけではない。","en":"Trolls are a demi-human race that inhabit the Demon Realm. They are monstrous giants standing about three meters tall. In the Human Realm, dark forces frequently employ them alongside orcs and ogres. Though not very intelligent, they are ferocious, possess immense strength, and are exceptionally tough—shallow wounds heal instantly. If a troll is female, it will violate any woman of any race and devour her alive. They are vulnerable to ultraviolet light, which hardens their skin and makes them move extremely sluggishly, but, contrary to legend, they do not turn to stone."},"illustrator":null,"voiceActor":null,"forms":[{"id":"uni00128_1","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","levelMax":40,"stats":{"hp":[605,1210],"sp":[100,100],"atk":[70,140],"def":[57,115],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[0,0]},"spCharge":58,"skills":["1","30013"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Superhuman damage"}]},"30013":{"slot":"skill1","id":30013,"name":{"ja":"棍棒叩きつけ"},"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃する"}}],"effe